<title>GERMANY: TABLE-W.German prelim July CPI rises 0.5 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>TABLE-W.German prelim July CPI rises 0.5 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    July 97	  June 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.5	     +0.3</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.8	     +1.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    116.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The new data are provisional. The Statistics Office said it would publish final figures in mid-August.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
